msgid "The birth_date, birth_time, lat, and lon attributes are required (tz defaults to UTC; pass an IANA name or decimal hours for accuracy). Example: %s"
msgstr "birth_date, birth_time, lat और lon विशेषताएँ आवश्यक हैं (tz का डिफ़ॉल्ट UTC है; सटीकता के लिए IANA नाम या दशमलव घंटे दें)। उदाहरण: %s"

msgid "The date, lat, and lon attributes are required (tz defaults to 5.5 IST). Example: %s"
